menu "Nordic Wi-Fi status page"
    config NORDIC_AP_SSID
        string "Access point name"
        default "Nordic-Ski-Setup"
    config NORDIC_AP_PASSWORD
        string "Access point password (8-63 printable ASCII characters)"
        default ""
        help
            Empty disables Wi-Fi. Set locally before flashing.
            This value is stored in the firmware image. Do not publish the
            configured sdkconfig or firmware binaries containing your password.
endmenu
